From 061d9e0850f07cb329655078d0f64bda75484866 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FreeholdOS Build <build@freeholdos.local>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:38:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] datamap: add the pure core of the Data Map service

Host name validation, the classifier file parser, the bounded per-user store, the link derivation,
the history file codec and the per-user settings. None of it uses an Android class, so it is
checked on the host (datamap/tests/host in freeholdos-platform).
